# The app document must not be framed (bead qrcode-22b): frame-ancestors is header-only, so a
# <meta> CSP cannot carry it, and the result panel's "Return" (x-callback) and "Open" buttons are
# clickjackable once the document can be framed. This file is the static-host form of the policy
# (Netlify / Cloudflare Pages read `_headers`); any other host must send the same two headers
# itself - see the "Framing" section in README.md.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
